{
  title: "resolvedp"
}
---
### NAME

    resolvedp() - Determine whether a promise has settled with a value.

### SYNOPSIS

    int resolvedp( promise p );

### DESCRIPTION

    Determine whether a promise has settled with a value.

### PARAMETERS

    p  (promise)
       The promise to test.

### RETURN VALUES

    (int) 1 if the promise has resolved, 0 if it is still pending, has
    rejected, or was cancelled.
